WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.320
Nero, Rocco's been waiting for you.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Password.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:05.560
Come on, man.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:06.840
Password.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.540
Oh, my favorite day.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:18.980
Tuna Tuesday.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.780
Remember, we used to be tigers.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:22.440
Tigers.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.840
Watch this.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:25.840
I got it!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:28.760
Get away!

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.060
You're dead, love.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.340
But you've got nine lives.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:37.760
What?

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:38.520
Be still.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:40.140
Lovely.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.240
Eight more lives?

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.000
This is amazing!

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:43.940
Amazing, yes.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.560
Get over here.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.340
Please don't touch me.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:49.240
Okey dokey.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.124
Now, if you're a cat

00:00:51.124 --> 00:00:53.260
in Venice, you work for Rocco.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.420
You took me in.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.600
Come on, little one.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.560
Taught me everything I knew.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.280
Lucky guy.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.060
Isn't life great?

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:07.280
Stealing, party, dying occasionally.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.120
You guys could really use some pillows down here.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.860
Big job today.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:15.080
A rare violin from a street musician.

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:19.080
Oh, hello there.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:22.780
Okay, Mr. Grumpy.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:30.300
Wait! Come back!

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:31.800
Come on!

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:35.780
You've only got one whisker left.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.200
Maybe this is the time to ask yourself

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.760
if you've made good use of your whiskers.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.200
My life has been meaningless.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.280
Are you trying to fly the coop?

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.500
I stay, Rocco kills me.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.020
No, no, no.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.940
Finish the job.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.580
Oh, scandaloso.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:05.080
Or I leave and I get everything I ever wanted.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.540
Say no more.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:08.720
Oh, no.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:10.160
It's high time.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.040
Is it Saturday already?

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:15.460
The week just flew by.
